### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/

###

### Get all games
GET http://localhost:3000/games

###

### Get a single game
GET http://localhost:3000/games/1

###

### Get a game that doesn't exist
GET http://localhost:3000/games/999

###

### Add a new game
POST http://localhost:3000/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Baldur's Gate 3",
  "genre": "RPG",
  "platform": "PC",
  "releaseYear": 2023,
  "totalHoursPlayed": 200
}

###

### Update hours played on game 1
PATCH http://localhost:3000/games/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "totalHoursPlayed": 150
}

###

### Delete game 2
DELETE http://localhost:3000/games/2

###

### Confirm game 2 is gone
GET http://localhost:3000/games